<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>The "Cloud": Thinking the cloud is an abstract "space" rather than a physical server farm managed via virtualisation.</li>
        <li>Multi-core performance: Assuming a 4-core processor is simply 4x faster than a single core, ignoring software-level threading limitations.</li>
        <li>Register updates: Believing the PC updates at the end of the cycle rather than immediately after the fetch.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

